<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Inapa results due March 20.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Inapa results due March 20.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese paper company Inapa-Investimentos, Participacoes e Gestao will present its 1996 results at 1100 GMT on March 20, the company said.</p>
</text>
